      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 5.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.38,
      "end_seconds": 15.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "not at all, please sit what seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 16.39,
      "end_seconds": 21.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "hello, doctor i hope it's alright if I stay in for this"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.48,
      "end_seconds": 27.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.91,
      "end_seconds": 38.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Mainly a lump in my left breast. There's a couple of other things but that's the the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.6,
      "end_seconds": 42.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.61,
      "end_seconds": 55.89,
      "duration_seconds": 12.28,
      "text": "Probably two months. Yeah. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.36,
      "end_seconds": 59.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.49,
      "end_seconds": 77.64,
      "duration_seconds": 17.15,
      "text": "The lump being there for a month goes along with it most of the time. The lump being there for a month? That's been for about two weeks. There was slight tenderness yes but that went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.58,
      "end_seconds": 83.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.53,
      "end_seconds": 100.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "that's it, just a a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.51,
      "end_seconds": 129.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air pulse is 80 beats a minute temp 36.6 degrees blood pressure 114 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.37,
      "end_seconds": 131.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.7,
      "end_seconds": 136.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.34,
      "end_seconds": 142.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.86,
      "end_seconds": 145.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.91,
      "end_seconds": 169.19,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "there is a firm, mobile, round lump about two centimetres in the upper outer part and no lumps under the arm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.06,
      "end_seconds": 176.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "so so you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.41,
      "end_seconds": 197.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "how about skin dimpling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.97,
      "end_seconds": 202.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Hmm no none no skin dimpling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.54,
      "end_seconds": 208.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Mm, okay. A few quick ones: nipple discharge, weight loss or lump under the arm?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.67,
      "end_seconds": 213.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Right, no, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.81,
      "end_seconds": 218.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.8,
      "end_seconds": 221.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.95,
      "end_seconds": 226.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.68,
      "end_seconds": 231.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.32,
      "end_seconds": 235.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.98,
      "end_seconds": 240.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.32,
      "end_seconds": 244.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Okay, are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.93,
      "end_seconds": 249.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.02,
      "end_seconds": 262.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.96,
      "end_seconds": 269.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "I had an operation for a hernia last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.18,
      "end_seconds": 274.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "alright, does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.17,
      "end_seconds": 280.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "my grandmother had dementia my uncle has high cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.91,
      "end_seconds": 300.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "alright, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy? It helps to to be thorough at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.26,
      "end_seconds": 305.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 307.8,
      "end_seconds": 315.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "it's meant to be once a day, though I don't see she take it every time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.36,
      "end_seconds": 320.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "it's lansoprazole, before breakfast for my acidity"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.43,
      "end_seconds": 323.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.92,
      "end_seconds": 325.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "30 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.77,
      "end_seconds": 330.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "okay since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.5,
      "end_seconds": 339.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "about about a year i used to take allopurinol but I stopped it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.44,
      "end_seconds": 347.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses? I ask cos it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.17,
      "end_seconds": 355.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Gout, for about a year. Acid reflux, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.27,
      "end_seconds": 377.76,
      "duration_seconds": 21.49,
      "text": "Right, so acid reflux is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is a breast lump needing triple assessment. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. We shouldn't forget a benign fibroadenoma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.61,
      "end_seconds": 393.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "let me just check I've got this right you've had a lump in your left breast for two months, and no weight loss or lump under the arm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.47,
      "end_seconds": 396.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "yes, you've got it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.37,
      "end_seconds": 426.11,
      "duration_seconds": 28.74,
      "text": "We should do a mammogram and ultrasound for breast lump. I want a needle biopsy done, that's for breast lump. This does not mean cancer, but we do arrange a specialist one-stop clinic to be sure. The breast clinic would be the the right next step, I'll refer you. I'd like you back after the clinic. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.88,
      "end_seconds": 431.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "so, I come back after the clinic is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.64,
      "end_seconds": 438.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 440.0,
      "end_seconds": 441.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 443.32,
      "end_seconds": 444.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
  ]
